    "detailed_description": "<strong>Movement is Life</strong><br>Use the cursor to dodge and attack enemies when the ship\u2019s weapon is charged<br><br><strong>Shop for Upgrades</strong><br>Shops present many powerful upgrades, but for a price. Be sure to plan ahead!<br><br><strong>Survival is Key</strong><br>Each ship\u2019s weapon has a different way to destroy enemies, learn the best way to use each one!<br><br><strong>Unlock New Content</strong><br>Death is not the end! Upgrade ships after every run to reach their full potential!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><br>8 Unique Ships<br><br>7 Complex Enemy Types<br><br>100+ Upgrade Cards<br><br>2 Devastating bosses<br><br>18 Challenging Achievements",
